    "summary": "Errata adding the Corsairs and Travelling Players army rule. For a DRUKHARI Army Faction, your army can contain HARLEQUINS units and ANHRATHE units although they do not carry the DRUKHARI Faction keyword. Together, those HARLEQUINS and/or ANHRATHE units may total up to 250 pts at Incursion, 500 pts at Strike Force and 750 pts at Onslaught. None of these HARLEQUINS or ANHRATHE models can be your WARLORD or be given Enhancements.",
